    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="In this example we demonstrate how to setup vector field sensors at custom orientations with respect to the simulation coordinate system. We first build a sensor array aligned with the simulation coords in the same way as the previous example. We then build a sensor array with the sensors rotated and compare this to the case with no rotation.">

