    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="In all our previous examples we have looked at a 2D solid mechanics simulation and applied displacement sensors to the vector field. Here we will build a custom vector field sensor array on a 3D simulation of a small linear elastic cube loaded in tension with the addition of an applied thermal gradient.">

